Z||000003||Oreif||03-06-2001||12:04 PM||||They are selling the old Diversified Glass (DGP) SD4 body kit. DGP went out of business in 1992. IRM and these folks have the license to sell the kits. The IMSA kit has smaller wheel wells because it's on the aero-nose (85GT, 86-87 SE) kit. The coupe kit has the larger wheel wells. See better pic below.<P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SD4-DGP.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
